  <h2>Accessibility Features on This Site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Valid semantic structure and hierarchical headings (H1–H3)</li>
    <li>Full keyboard navigation, including a "skip to main content" link</li>
    <li>A floating accessibility toolbar for text resizing, high-contrast mode, link underlining, and reduced motion</li>
    <li>Full support for Hebrew (RTL) and English (LTR)</li>
    <li>Alt text for images</li>
    <li>Text-to-background color contrast has been reviewed</li>
  </ul>

